{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/style/obligations","title":"Context obligations","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"context-obligations","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Context obligations"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Level 3. "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Adopted per whole route"}]},{"t":"text","text":", and that granularity is the whole point of"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"this page."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"what-it-is-for","children":[{"t":"text","text":"What it is for"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A sticky element needs a scroll port. A scroll-state query needs an element"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"declaring the container. Get either wrong and nothing errors — the component"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"simply never appears, or sticks to the wrong box, and you find out in a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"screenshot weeks later."}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  craftStyles,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  display,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  insetBlockEnd,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  position,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  provides,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  requires,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  scrollPort,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  space,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"} ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/style'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"backToTop"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craftStyles","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'backToTop'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  anchor: [","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"requires","kind":"function"},{"text":"(scrollPort.block),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    position.sticky,","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"insetBlockEnd","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"space","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"4","kind":"number"},{"text":")),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  ],","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"shell"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craftStyles","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'appShell'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  main: [","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"provides","kind":"function"},{"text":"(scrollPort.block), display.block],","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"requires"},{"t":"text","text":" is attached to the "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"class"}]},{"t":"text","text":", not the sheet, so the error names a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"rule rather than a file. And "},{"t":"code","text":"provides(...)"},{"t":"text","text":" returns the CSS effect "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"and"}]},{"t":"text","text":" the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"discharge in the same object: since "},{"t":"code","text":"overflow"},{"t":"text","text":" is not in the property table,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"this is the only road to "},{"t":"code","text":"overflow-block: auto"},{"t":"text","text":". Claiming to provide without"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"laying the CSS is not something anyone can write."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"where-it-becomes-an-error","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Where it becomes an error"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Nowhere, until a component seals:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { craftComponent } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/component'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"craftComponent","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'AppShell'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", { seals: [","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"true","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"] }, template);","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Until then the requirement "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"travels"}]},{"t":"text","text":" — an ancestor still has the right to"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"answer it, and complaining early would be wrong. Sealing says \"from here up,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"nobody will\"."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Remove the provider and the typecheck fails:"}]},{"t":"quote","children":[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"ERROR_unmet_context_requirement: \"'scrollPort.block' is required by this subtree and nothing above it provides one. declare it on the layout component that owns the scrollable area. An overflow on the direct parent would create a second scroll port, and the sticky element would stick to the wrong container.\""}]}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"What is missing, where to put it, and what the obvious wrong fix would do."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"why-the-granularity-is-the-route","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Why the granularity is the route"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The requirement is carried by the type of the render tree. It crosses a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"component boundary only where the tree is typed all the way through. One"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"component in the path that hands back a loosely typed subtree, and the demand"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"stops travelling — silently, because nothing is wrong with "},{"t":"em","children":[{"t":"text","text":"that"}]},{"t":"text","text":" component."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"So level 3 is not something you get for the components you migrated. You get it"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"for a route once the route is migrated, and not before. The dependency graph"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"reports which components are not covered rather than reporting a clean bill:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { extractionGaps, undischargedObligations } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/dev-tools'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"extractionGaps","kind":"function"},{"text":"(graph); ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// components no sheet is known to style","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"undischargedObligations","kind":"function"},{"text":"(graph); ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// required somewhere, discharged nowhere","kind":"comment"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"the-marked-way-out","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The marked way out"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { scrollPort, unsafeAssume } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/style'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"unsafeAssume","kind":"function"},{"text":"(scrollPort.block, ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'the host page owns the scroll port'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"ts","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Discharges without laying the CSS, for the cases the model cannot see — a shell"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"owned by someone else. It propagates "},{"t":"code","text":"unproven"},{"t":"text","text":", so the graph counts it as debt."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"An escape hatch that did not bubble up would be a design bug, not a convenience."}]}],"outline":[{"level":2,"id":"what-it-is-for","text":"What it is for"},{"level":2,"id":"where-it-becomes-an-error","text":"Where it becomes an error"},{"level":2,"id":"why-the-granularity-is-the-route","text":"Why the granularity is the route"},{"level":2,"id":"the-marked-way-out","text":"The marked way out"}]}